    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the Cookie Store!</h2>Would you be interested in a cute, happy, and colorful life as a cafe owner? You can find it in this Visual Novel! Please take a look at our menu below.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Menu:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> get closer to your employees and friends<br>- 6 different character routes<br></li><li> three possible endings of the main story<br>- but the game will not end there...<br></li><li> uplifting music and colorful art<br>- partially animated characters<br>- 14 illustrations and characters gallery to unlock<br></li><li> test your skills and... luck<br>- simple minigame simulating financial progress (tutorial included)</li></ul><br><i>Full course might take about 3 hours or more (all routes, depending on reading speed and time in minigames)</i>",
